# Unused — safe to `git rm backend/Dockerfile.lambda` by hand (this sandbox
# could not delete it directly; see infra/modules/run-api/ecr.tf).
#
# The hosted API is a zip-packaged Lambda (backend/scripts/build-lambda-zip.sh,
# codeignite.api.lambda_handler.handler), not a container image — this repo
# does not use ECR, ECS, or EKS anywhere, and Lambda's container image
# support only pulls from ECR regardless of where the image is built or
# pushed. See docs/code-playground-hosted-api-plan.md §0 and §3.
